OL,3,AUK national tests positive for Ebola
OL,4,Avirus in DR Congo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British national who is in the
OL,7,FDemocratic Republic of Congo has tested
OL,8,Fpositive for Ebola, the UK government
OL,9,Fhas confirmed.
OL,11,FA spokesperson said the UK "has
OL,12,Fwell-established procedures for dealing
OL,13,Fwith cases like this" and that the risk
OL,14,Fto the public remains low.
OL,16,FIt is the first confirmed case of a UK
OL,17,Fnational contracting Ebola during the
OL,18,Fmost recent outbreak of the rare but
OL,19,Fdeadly virus in DR Congo, which has so
OL,20,Ffar led to more than 5,000 deaths.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
