OL,3,A'This is a disaster': Angry Republicans
OL,4,Ablame Trump for midterms defeat
OL,5,
OL,6,FInside the Republican Party, initial
OL,7,Fshock at the stunning election results
OL,8,Fon Tuesday night quickly gave way to
OL,9,Fanger with US President Donald Trump.
OL,11,FAfter Democrats won upset after upset
OL,12,Fin deep-red states like Texas, Kansas
OL,13,Fand South Carolina, some Republicans
OL,14,Ffocused their ire on Trump, arguing
OL,15,Fthat his focus on his legacy and
OL,16,Findifference to voter concerns cost the
OL,17,Fparty control of Congress.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
